- Per-tenant FIFO within a bounded global queue
- Credit-based aging to enforce latency bounds while preventing starvation
- Backpressure semantics when queue is full
- Race-free dispatcher and worker coordination in Go or Python asyncio
- Test plan: latency under burst, fairness across tenants, shutdown behavior

